================================================================================
BUILT ON
================================================================================

This project builds on terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner, which solves Kubernetes
cluster creation on Hetzner Cloud. This kit is what you install afterwards.

    terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner
    https://github.com/mysticaltech/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner
    Licensed under the MIT License.

The relationship is a pinned module dependency, not a fork or a vendored copy.
No source from that project is redistributed here. The node layer in this
repository is a root module that consumes the published module and supplies its
own inputs.

That project and its maintainers solved the hard part of this stack — image
building, cloud-init, HA control planes, cloud controller and CSI wiring,
coordinated node upgrades. None of it is reimplemented here, and this kit would
not exist without it.

================================================================================
COMPONENTS DEPLOYED BY THIS KIT
================================================================================

This repository deploys third-party software it does not redistribute. Each
component is fetched from its own upstream at deploy time and remains subject to
its own licence. Notable components include Flux, cert-manager, Traefik, the
Gateway API, SOPS, age, the VictoriaMetrics stack, Grafana, Vector, restic, the
Kubernetes cluster autoscaler and the system upgrade controller.

Consult each project for its licence terms. Nothing in this repository grants
